    "title": "Union County data center project clears up foreign funding rumors - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Beauge ,\n5 hours ago ALLENWOOD — No Russian money is being used to finance a proposed data center campus in a Union County business park, the developer says. PNK Group addressed that rumor Wednesday when it released six pages of answers to questions raised at an April 2 open house in Allenwood and afterwards. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
